# KRODEX — Supabase migrations
#
# Phase 0: this directory is intentionally empty. The first migration
# is created in Phase 1 (core data model + persistence) per the
# Project Implementation Plan.
#
# Each migration file MUST be named with a 14-digit timestamp prefix
# (e.g. 20260101000000_init_schema.sql) so that `supabase db reset`
# applies them in order.
